# Projects (YYYY-MM-DD__campaign__piece) are working folders, not part of this
# public repo: they carry agent traces, drafts, licensed media and local paths.
# Keep them on the machine (and in a private repo or Exo media storage if needed).
/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]__*/

# HyperFrames output and caches, per project
*/renders/
*/.thumbnails/
*/.waveform-cache/
*/.hyperframes/
node_modules/

# Brand fonts are copied into each project from brand/ (scripts/sync-brand.mjs)
*/assets/fonts/

# This repo is public: licensed or third-party media stays on the machine.
# Put it in a project's assets/local/ (music beds, stock or client photos, footage).
*/assets/local/
